# No Code Dumps

When explaining changes or analysis, do NOT paste large code blocks or full file contents into the response. The user will not read them and they waste tokens.

- Describe what you changed and why in plain language.
- Use short inline references (e.g. `ClassName.MethodName`) to point at specific code.
- Only show code if the user explicitly asks to see it, or if a tiny snippet (< 5 lines) is essential for clarity.
